  "result": "All 23 render tests pass! Here's a summary of the renderInvoiceText enhancements:\n\n**New Features Implemented:**\n\n1. **Line Discounts** - Each line with a discount now shows the discount amount:\n   ```\n   2 Development (hour) \u20ac95.00 \u20ac190.00 (10% off: \u20ac19.00)\n   ```\n\n2. **Voucher Display** - Vouchers appear on their own line before the total:\n   ```\n   Voucher: \u20ac50.00\n   Total: \u20ac999.50\n   ```\n\n3. **Due Date** - Issued invoices display the due date:\n   ```\n   Total: \u20ac999.50\n   Due: 2025-12-29\n   ```\n\n4. **Payment Tracking** - Invoices with payments show the total paid:\n   ```\n   Total: \u20ac999.50\n   Due: 2025-12-29\n   Paid: \u20ac500.00\n   ```\n\n**Test Coverage:**\n- \u2705 Line discount display (single and multiple lines)\n- \u2705 Voucher line placement and formatting\n- \u2705 Due date visibility (shown for issued, hidden for draft)\n- \u2705 Payment amount calculation (single and multiple payments)\n- \u2705 Combined features rendering in correct order\n- \u2705 All original tests still pass\n\nThe implementation maintains immutability, proper money handling with banker's rounding, and clear formatting of all amounts in euros.",
